0:50:27", "2009-06-03 21:16:30", "2009-06-03 23:24:47"], "director": "M. Webber and J. S. Watson", "sound": "silent", "color": "black and white", "runtime": "0:12:45", "backup_location": "ia903603_7", "closed_captioning": "no"}, "reviews": [{"reviewbody": "Unlike many of the items I have reviewed, this is a short silent film. This is actually one of the finest silent films I have ever seen. I really enjoyed the dream-like special effects and the spooky atmosphere. If there is a plot, I think I missed it, but that doesn't matter, since it's the gorgeous array of images that is the reason to see this film. One could write a 10-page essay on the meaning of the facinating images in this short film.\n\nPicture quality is pretty good for an \"underground\" silent film.", "reviewtitle": "A True Gem", "reviewer": "Seto-Kaiba_Is_Stupid", "reviewdate": "2009-06-05 05:50:42", "createdate": "2009-06-05 05:50:42", "stars": "5"}, {"reviewbody": "Well not sure what to expect, especially as not a fan of silent films, and the fact that when they do have some music/other sound track are generally awful.\nIn this case though I thought the music ie solo piano was just wonderful ! And really added to the film.\nFor me a welcome change from the usual crap and the film was incredibly moody and surreal.\nI'll bet Dali would love it too LOL.", "reviewtitle": "A little gem ! !", "reviewer": "cloudeagle", "reviewdate": "2013-03-09 01:08:58", "createdate": "2013-03-09 01:08:58", "stars": "4"}, {"reviewbody": "definitely read (or listen to -- https://ia800208.us.archive.org/24/items/works_poe_raven_edition_vol2_0912/ravencollectedpoevol2_08_poe.mp3) the story first", "reviewtitle": "gorgeous ", "reviewer": "squidling", "reviewer_itemname": "@squidling", "reviewdate": "2020-03-11 21:46:28", "createdate": "2020-03-11 21:46:28", "stars": "5"}, {"reviewtitle": "WAT", "reviewbody": "???", "stars": "0", "reviewer": "LouiseLa", "reviewdate": "2024-06-16 16:48:59", "createdate": "2024-06-16 16:48:59", "reviewer_itemname": "@louisela"}], "server": "dn600207.us.archive.org", "simplelists": {"solo_manifest": {"solo_manifest_dn600207": {"sys_changed_by": {"source": "task", "task_id": "5415959968"}, "sys_last_changed": "2026-06-04 07:43:10.79294"}}}, "solo": true, "uniq": 1570131629, "workable_servers": ["dn600207.us.archive.org"]}